  "description": "*\"I'm never getting married!\"*\nDeok, a slave girl, would sooner choose death than let her future kids inherit this life. But then her master presents her with an absurd offer: *\"I'll make you a noblewoman.\"* Deok is elated at the thought of escaping slavehood. But first, she must become a lady. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
